  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Wade’s journey from a small Spanish town to the world’s biggest stages has been years in the making, and this year he climbs into the Top 100 for the first time. And it’s no surprise, as gigs at Tomorrowland, Awakenings, Loveland and Kappa FuturFestival all made the calendar, with his Crystal Garden set at Tomorrowland Belgium standing out as the highlight. Back-to-backs with Patrick Topping and GORDO pushed him into unfamiliar territory this year too, while his sound continues to lean on groove above all else: heavy bass, sharp drums, catchy vocals, and plenty of swing make him a big-room house favourite. Next up, his new all-night-long concept, In The Hood, launches in Buenos Aires in November.",
